msgid ""
"At least two players must join. Everyone confirms Ready; the host then "
"starts the game. Changes to the player list reset readiness."
msgstr ""
"Au moins deux joueurs doivent rejoindre la partie. Tous confirment Prêt, "
"puis l'hôte démarre. Toute modification de la liste des joueurs réinitialise"
" cet état."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Simulation and construction begin together after the host starts."
msgstr ""
"La simulation et la construction commencent ensemble au démarrage par "
"l'hôte."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Net wealth"
msgstr "Patrimoine net"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Open scoreboard"
msgstr "Ouvrir le classement"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Endless game · no scoring"
msgstr "Partie sans fin · sans classement"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Victory target: %s"
msgstr "Objectif de victoire : %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "You: %s / %s"
msgstr "Vous : %s / %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Leading: %s · %s"
msgstr "En tête : %s · %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Net wealth = city funds minus outstanding debt."
msgstr "Patrimoine net = trésorerie municipale moins dettes restantes."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Population of your own city."
msgstr "Population de votre ville."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "History"
msgstr "Historique"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Unranked"
msgstr "Hors classement"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"History begins when the game starts; a new sample is recorded each month."
msgstr ""
"L'historique commence au démarrage de la partie ; un relevé est enregistré "
"chaque mois."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Month %d"
msgstr "Mois %d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Player colours · hover over a line for exact values"
msgstr "Couleurs des joueurs · survolez une courbe pour les valeurs exactes"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Rematch · rotate starts"
msgstr "Revanche · changer les positions de départ"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"No unused fair starting positions remain. Create a new game with new "
"terrain."
msgstr ""
"Il ne reste aucune position de départ équitable inutilisée. Créez une "
"nouvelle partie avec un nouveau terrain."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can propose a rematch after the result."
msgstr "Seul l'hôte peut proposer une revanche après le résultat."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Rematch prepared with new starting positions. Everyone must confirm Ready "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Revanche préparée avec de nouvelles positions de départ. Tous doivent à "
"nouveau confirmer Prêt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Target held: %d / %d game days"
msgstr "Objectif maintenu : %d / %d jours de jeu"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Unranked · city founded after the start"
msgstr "Hors classement · ville fondée après le départ"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Stay at or above the target for one full game year. Dropping below resets "
"the timer."
msgstr ""
"Restez au niveau de l'objectif ou au-dessus pendant une année de jeu "
"complète. Passer en dessous remet le compteur à zéro."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Rules are fixed at start: hold the target for one game year; late-founded "
"cities are unranked. Shared starts receive equal land grants."
msgstr ""
"Règles fixées au départ : maintenir l'objectif un an de jeu ; les villes "
"fondées plus tard sont hors classement. Les départs partagés reçoivent des "
"terrains égaux."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Player loans"
msgstr "Prêts entre joueurs"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Both players confirm the terms. Interest is paid each year; principal is due"
" at maturity. Unpaid amounts remain debt; interest does not compound."
msgstr ""
"Les deux joueurs confirment les conditions. Les intérêts sont payés chaque "
"année ; le capital est dû à l'échéance. Les impayés restent une dette ; les "
"intérêts ne se capitalisent pas."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Proposal"
msgstr "Proposition"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Request a loan"
msgstr "Demander un prêt"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Offer a loan"
msgstr "Proposer un prêt"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Fixed annual interest (%)"
msgstr "Intérêt annuel fixe (%)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Term (game years)"
msgstr "Durée (années de jeu)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Confirm and send proposal"
msgstr "Confirmer et envoyer"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s → %s · %s · %d%% annually · %d years"
msgstr "%s → %s · %s · %d%% par an · %d ans"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Accept fixed terms"
msgstr "Accepter les conditions fixes"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Outstanding: %s · Unpaid interest: %s · Maturity: game day %d"
msgstr "Restant dû : %s · Intérêts impayés : %s · Échéance : jour de jeu %d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid loan terms or contract limit reached."
msgstr "Conditions de prêt invalides ou limite de contrats atteinte."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan proposal sent. The other player must confirm the fixed terms."
msgstr ""
"Proposition de prêt envoyée. L'autre joueur doit confirmer les conditions "
"fixes."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan proposal withdrawn or declined."
msgstr "Proposition de prêt retirée ou refusée."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The lender cannot fund this loan or the receiving treasury is full."
msgstr ""
"Le prêteur ne peut pas financer ce prêt ou la trésorerie du bénéficiaire est"
" pleine."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan accepted. Annual interest and the maturity date are fixed."
msgstr "Prêt accepté. L'intérêt annuel et la date d'échéance sont fixés."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This loan action is no longer available."
msgstr "Cette opération de prêt n'est plus disponible."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Player loans require separate city finances."
msgstr "Les prêts entre joueurs exigent des finances municipales séparées."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid saved competition data."
msgstr "Données de compétition sauvegardées invalides."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Awaiting host confirmation…"
msgstr "En attente de confirmation de l'hôte…"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Region %d"
msgstr "Région %d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Scored competitions require undeveloped starting terrain. Create a new city."
msgstr ""
"Les compétitions classées exigent un terrain de départ vierge. Créez une "
"nouvelle ville."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Withdraw"
msgstr "Retirer"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Quit multiplayer"
msgstr "Quitter le multijoueur"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Save the multiplayer game before quitting? All connected players will be "
"disconnected."
msgstr ""
"Sauvegarder la partie multijoueur avant de quitter ? Tous les joueurs "
"connectés seront déconnectés."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Save and quit"
msgstr "Sauvegarder et quitter"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Quit without saving"
msgstr "Quitter sans sauvegarder"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can change the game speed."
msgstr "Seul l'hôte peut modifier la vitesse du jeu."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Select a city to visit. You can watch every city and send emergency "
"assistance during disasters."
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez une ville à visiter. Vous pouvez observer toutes les villes et "
"envoyer des secours lors de catastrophes."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Apply colour"
msgstr "Appliquer la couleur"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Price for additional neutral land. At the shared start, every city receives "
"an equal free starting area; its treasury stays intact. Saved games retain "
"their rules."
msgstr ""
"Prix du terrain neutre supplémentaire. Au départ partagé, chaque ville "
"reçoit la même surface gratuite ; sa trésorerie reste intacte. Les "
"sauvegardes conservent leurs règles."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Host a game on this computer, or connect to an existing host."
msgstr ""
"Hébergez une partie sur cet ordinateur ou connectez-vous à un hôte existant."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Your name in the lobby, chat and scoreboard."
msgstr "Votre nom dans le salon, la discussion et le classement."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Choose a custom colour for your cursor, territory and statistics, then Apply"
" colour."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez une couleur pour votre curseur, territoire et statistiques, puis "
"Appliquer la couleur."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Enter the host computer's LAN address or reachable IP address."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez l'adresse locale ou l'adresse IP accessible de l'ordinateur hôte."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The host and joining players must use the same TCP port."
msgstr "L'hôte et les joueurs doivent utiliser le même port TCP."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Co-op: one shared city. Shared: separate cities on one map. Region: "
"independent neighbouring city maps."
msgstr ""
"Coopératif : une ville commune. Partagé : villes séparées sur une carte. "
"Régional : cartes indépendantes de villes voisines."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Generate new terrain, or continue a saved multiplayer game. Saved games keep"
" their rules and player seats."
msgstr ""
"Générez un nouveau terrain ou continuez une sauvegarde multijoueur. Les "
"sauvegardes conservent leurs règles et les places des joueurs."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Leave empty to allow joining without a password."
msgstr "Laissez vide pour autoriser l'accès sans mot de passe."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Enter the game's password if the host set one; otherwise leave empty."
msgstr "Saisissez le mot de passe défini par l'hôte ; sinon laissez vide."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Configure the city, then wait in the lobby until everyone is ready."
msgstr ""
"Configurez la ville, puis attendez dans le salon que tous soient prêts."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Connect and select a new or reserved player seat. The host controls the game"
" rules."
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous et sélectionnez une place nouvelle ou réservée. L'hôte "
"contrôle les règles."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Population: residents of your own city. Suggested targets: 2,000 for a short"
" development goal, 10,000 for a medium goal, 50,000 for a long goal."
msgstr ""
"Population : habitants de votre ville. Objectifs suggérés : 2 000 pour un "
"objectif court, 10 000 pour un moyen, 50 000 pour un long."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Net wealth: treasury minus bank bonds and outstanding player debt. Suggested"
" targets: $50,000, $100,000 or $500,000 for increasingly long economic "
"goals."
msgstr ""
"Patrimoine net : trésorerie moins emprunts bancaires et dettes envers les "
"joueurs. Objectifs suggérés : $50 000, $100 000 ou $500 000 pour des "
"objectifs économiques de plus en plus longs."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Build without a victory target or time limit."
msgstr "Construisez sans objectif de victoire ni limite de temps."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"The target must then be held for one full game year (300 game days). At "
"uninterrupted simulation speed, that year takes about 4 minutes at Turtle, 2"
" at Llama or 1 at Cheetah. Swallow advances one day per processed frame "
"(about 5 seconds per year at 60 simulation frames/s). Development time is "
"additional and depends on difficulty, terrain, experience, pauses and "
"computer performance; these are not match-duration guarantees."
msgstr ""
"L'objectif doit ensuite être maintenu une année de jeu complète (300 jours)."
" Sans interruption, cette année dure environ 4 minutes à Tortue, 2 à Lama ou"
" 1 à Guépard. Hirondelle avance d'un jour par image traitée (environ 5 "
"secondes par an à 60 images de simulation/s). Le développement prend un "
"temps supplémentaire selon la difficulté, le terrain, l'expérience, les "
"pauses et les performances ; ces durées ne garantissent pas celle de la "
"partie."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Choose the lender and principal. The game sets the bond rate. Interest "
"settles with the annual budget; there is no maturity date. Repay when funds "
"permit."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez le prêteur et le capital. Le jeu fixe le taux des emprunts. Les "
"intérêts sont réglés avec le budget annuel ; il n'y a pas d'échéance. "
"Remboursez selon vos moyens."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Lender"
msgstr "Prêteur"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s → %s · %s · %d%% annually"
msgstr "%s → %s · %s · %d%% par an"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Approve loan"
msgstr "Approuver le prêt"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Outstanding: %s · Unpaid interest: %s"
msgstr "Restant dû : %s · Intérêts impayés : %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Repay principal"
msgstr "Rembourser le capital"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Choose a lender and a principal in $10,000 bond units."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez un prêteur et un capital par tranches d'emprunt de $10 000."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The normal bond credit limit does not permit this loan."
msgstr "La limite habituelle des emprunts n'autorise pas ce prêt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan requested. The lender must approve the game's bond rate."
msgstr "Prêt demandé. Le prêteur doit approuver le taux d'emprunt du jeu."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The bond rate or credit limit changed. Send a new request."
msgstr ""
"Le taux d'emprunt ou la limite de crédit a changé. Envoyez une nouvelle "
"demande."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Loan accepted. Interest follows the bond budget; repay the principal when "
"funds permit."
msgstr ""
"Prêt accepté. Les intérêts suivent le budget des emprunts ; remboursez le "
"capital selon vos moyens."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Insufficient funds to repay this loan."
msgstr "Fonds insuffisants pour rembourser ce prêt."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan principal repaid."
msgstr "Capital remboursé."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "City names can only be changed in the lobby."
msgstr "Les noms des villes ne peuvent être modifiés que dans le salon."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "City name updated."
msgstr "Nom de ville mis à jour."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Click your city name to rename it before the game starts."
msgstr "Cliquez sur le nom de votre ville pour le modifier avant le départ."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can control disasters."
msgstr "Seul l'hôte peut contrôler les catastrophes."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can control disasters and simulation time."
msgstr ""
"Seul l'hôte peut contrôler les catastrophes et le temps de simulation."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "No purchasable tiles selected. Nothing was charged."
msgstr "Aucune case achetable sélectionnée. Aucun montant débité."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Select land belonging to another player to send a purchase request."
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez le terrain d'un autre joueur pour envoyer une demande d'achat."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Request land"
msgstr "Demander un terrain"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Select neutral tiles to buy at the displayed price. Owned tiles are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez des cases neutres à acheter au prix affiché. Les cases déjà "
"possédées sont ignorées."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Set a price, then select your land to offer."
msgstr "Fixez un prix, puis sélectionnez votre terrain à proposer."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Land: %d tiles · Total %s · Allowance %s · City funds %s"
msgstr "Terrain : %d cases · Total %s · Dotation %s · Trésorerie %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid debug value."
msgstr "Valeur de débogage invalide."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid debug action."
msgstr "Action de débogage invalide."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Debug action applied to your city."
msgstr "Action de débogage appliquée à votre ville."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Wait for the connection to be restored."
msgstr "Attendez le rétablissement de la connexion."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Debug request sent to the host."
msgstr "Demande de débogage envoyée à l'hôte."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%d tiles · %s: %s"
msgstr "%d cases · %s : %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%d tiles · %s: %s · %s per tile"
msgstr "%d cases · %s : %s · %s par case"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s lost the connection."
msgstr "%s a perdu la connexion."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s · %d tiles"
msgstr "%s · %d cases"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s · %d tiles · %s"
msgstr "%s · %d cases · %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Administration · %s · %s: %s (%s → %s)"
msgstr "Administration · %s · %s : %s (%s → %s)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Awaiting response"
msgstr "En attente de réponse"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Balance after transfer: %s"
msgstr "Solde après transfert : %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Buildings: %d · Moving objects: %d"
msgstr "Bâtiments : %d · Objets mobiles : %d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Change price"
msgstr "Modifier le prix"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "City territories"
msgstr "Territoires municipaux"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Counteroffer"
msgstr "Contre-offre"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Counteroffer sent. The other player must confirm the new price."
msgstr "Contre-offre envoyée. L'autre joueur doit confirmer le nouveau prix."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Game goal"
msgstr "Objectif de la partie"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid administration history."
msgstr "Historique administratif invalide."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid land protection map."
msgstr "Carte de protection foncière invalide."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid starting handicap."
msgstr "Avantage de départ invalide."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Land trade"
msgstr "Transactions foncières"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Inbox"
msgstr "Réception"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Outbox"
msgstr "Envoi"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Not enough connected land for these starts and reserved expansion areas. "
"Adjust handicaps or generate new terrain."
msgstr ""
"Pas assez de terrain contigu pour ces départs et leurs réserves d'expansion."
" Ajustez les avantages ou générez un nouveau terrain."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Offer price updated. Previous confirmations are no longer valid."
msgstr "Prix mis à jour. Les confirmations précédentes ne sont plus valides."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can assign handicaps before a new game starts."
msgstr ""
"Seul l'hôte peut attribuer les avantages avant le départ d'une nouvelle "
"partie."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can use debug actions."
msgstr "Seul l'hôte peut utiliser les actions de débogage."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Publish offer"
msgstr "Publier l'offre"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Reserved land and public corridors cannot be traded."
msgstr ""
"Les terrains réservés et les corridors publics ne peuvent pas être échangés."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This parcel does not connect to the buyer's city."
msgstr "Cette parcelle n'est pas reliée à la ville de l'acheteur."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This sale would split the seller's remaining land."
msgstr "Cette vente diviserait le terrain restant du vendeur."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Review"
msgstr "Examiner"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Review land trade"
msgstr "Examiner la transaction foncière"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Rules are fixed at start: hold the target for one game year; late-founded "
"cities are unranked. Starting handicaps are visible in the lobby."
msgstr ""
"Règles fixées au départ : maintenir l'objectif un an de jeu ; les villes "
"fondées plus tard sont hors classement. Les avantages de départ sont "
"visibles dans le salon."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Select a city to visit. Other cities are read-only; their dialogs remain "
"private."
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez une ville à visiter. Les autres villes sont en lecture seule ; "
"leurs dialogues restent privés."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Select a parcel to review its owner, price and available trade action."
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez une parcelle pour examiner son propriétaire, son prix et "
"l'opération disponible."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Send counteroffer"
msgstr "Envoyer la contre-offre"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Solid: owned land. Hatched: reserved expansion. Grey: public road and power "
"corridors."
msgstr ""
"Uni : terrain possédé. Hachuré : réserve d'expansion. Gris : corridors "
